"\n"
"Contributors\n"
"------------\n"
"\n"
"- Luis Felipe Miléo mileo@kmee.com.br\n"
"\n"
"Other credits\n"
"-------------\n"
"\n"
"The development of this module has been financially supported by:\n"
"\n"
"- `KMEE <https://kmee.com.br/>`__\n"
"\n"
"Maintainers\n"
"-----------\n"
"\n"
"This module is part of the `KMEE/kmee-odoo-addons <https://github.com/KMEE/kmee-odoo-addons/tree/20.0/base_wip>`_ project on GitHub.\n"
"\n"
"You are welcome to contribute.\n"
